<title>荣誉消息通知 &amp; 荣誉分享 — 复盘数据表设计</title>

<h1>一、表总览</h1>

<table>
<thead><tr><th background-color="light-gray">表名</th><th background-color="light-gray">用途</th><th background-color="light-gray">类型</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td><code>honor_notification_event</code></td><td>荣誉通知触发与送达事件</td><td>事实表（明细）</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>honor_poster_action</code></td><td>海报/卡片互动行为</td><td>事实表（明细）</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>honor_share_tracking</code></td><td>分享渠道追踪</td><td>事实表（明细）</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>honor_invite_conversion</code></td><td>分享回流与邀请转化</td><td>事实表（明细）</td></tr>
